    "faq.q3": "What technologies and frameworks do you use?",
    "faq.a3": "Frontend: React, Next.js, Vue.js, React Native. Backend: Node.js, Python/Django, PostgreSQL. DevOps: AWS, Vercel, Docker. We choose the ideal stack for each project, not force a technology just because we master it.",
